# The oldest version that may update itself to a release built from this tree.
#
# scripts/release-sign.sh signs it into the release (the trusted comment of
# checksums.txt.minisig). One release version on one line, MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH with
# no leading zeros, pre-release part or build metadata (is_release_floor in
# scripts/lib/release-format.sh says exactly what is accepted); lines starting with
# # and blank lines are ignored. A release whose version is below it by SemVer precedence
# (a pre-release is below its own release) is refused when signing. Raise it, in the
# commit that adds the migration, when a release needs a manual step that an
# in-place update cannot do; leave it alone otherwise.
# docs/references/ci/README.md says what it means.
0.8.0
